  id: evt_100
  category: 5
  title: Blood Ritual
  description: A forbidden ritual offers power at a severe cost. Choose only if you
    can bear the price.
  choices:
  - label: Everything
    description: Set maximum HP to 5 (current HP is clamped, never healed) and gain
      a Legendary Artifact.
    effects: []
    interaction: 0
    requiredDiscardValue: 0
  - label: A Pool
    description: Pay 15 current HP (must remain alive) and gain an Epic Artifact.
    effects: []
    interaction: 0
    requiredDiscardValue: 0
  - label: A Drop
    description: Pay 5 current HP (must remain alive) and upgrade a random eligible
      Artifact by one tier.
    effects: []
    interaction: 0
    requiredDiscardValue: 0
